<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it initiated coverage of Ascend Communications Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not available.</p>
<p>-- Ascend shares were up 7/8 at 52-7/8 in active trading.</p>
</text>
